  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Pages that win property searches",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-63\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-63\">Pages that win <span class=\"accent\">property searches</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Three page types do most of the work in real estate SEO.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"vcards vcards--3\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"vcard\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__visual\"><figure class=\"mock mk-browser\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mk-browser__url\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-key\"/></svg> youragency.com/areas/dubai-marina</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mk-browser__body\"><div class=\"wf-hero\"><p class=\"wf-kicker\">Area guide</p><p class=\"wf-title\">Living in Dubai Marina</p><span class=\"wf-line\"></span><span class=\"wf-line wf-line--short\"></span><span class=\"wf-btn\">Book a visit</span></div><div class=\"wf-cards\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"wf-split\"><div><svg class=\"mk-map\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Map with business pins\"><rect width=\"400\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ece8e1\"/><path d=\"M0 60 C120 50 200 90 400 70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M60 0 C80 90 140 140 120 200\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M0 150 C150 160 260 130 400 170\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"7\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M280 0 L300 200\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d7ecd9\"/><rect x=\"310\" y=\"20\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d7ecd9\"/><g transform=\"translate(200 110)\"><path d=\"M0 0c-9-13-13-19-13-25a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 6-4 12-13 25z\" fill=\"#8f2cf4\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"-21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700\">★</text></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wf-line\"></span><span class=\"wf-line\"></span><span class=\"wf-line wf-line--short\"></span></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__body\"><h3 class=\"vcard__title\">Area guides</h3><p>Helpful guides to each neighbourhood: prices, schools, transport and lifestyle.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"vcard\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__visual\"><figure class=\"mock mk-browser\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mk-browser__url\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-key\"/></svg> youragency.com/projects/harbour-view</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mk-browser__body\"><div class=\"wf-hero\"><p class=\"wf-kicker\">Off-plan · 2026 handover</p><p class=\"wf-title\">Harbour View Residences</p><span class=\"wf-line\"></span><span class=\"wf-line wf-line--short\"></span><span class=\"wf-btn\">Book a viewing</span></div><div class=\"wf-cards\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"wf-faq\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__body\"><h3 class=\"vcard__title\">Project and listing pages</h3><p>Pages for each development and property type that rank above the portals.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"vcard\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Reviews · Google</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-stats mock-stats--3\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Average rating</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">4.9</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ from 4.2</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">New reviews / month</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">38</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +29</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Reply rate</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">100%</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ from 12%</span></div></div><div class=\"mk-review\"><div class=\"mk-review__head\"><span class=\"mk-avatar\">S</span><div><p class=\"mk-review__name\">Sara K.</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> · 2 days ago</p></div></div><p>Friendly team and spotless clinic. They explained every step and the price upfront.</p><p class=\"mk-review__reply\"><b>Response from the owner</b> Thank you, we’re glad the visit went well!</p></div><div class=\"mk-review\"><div class=\"mk-review__head\"><span class=\"mk-avatar\">O</span><div><p class=\"mk-review__name\">Omar H.</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"><span class=\"mk-stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</span></span> · 1 week ago</p></div></div><p>Booked online the same day. No waiting, and the follow-up call was a nice touch.</p><p class=\"mk-review__reply\"><b>Response from the owner</b> Thank you, we’re glad the visit went well!</p></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vcard__body\"><h3 class=\"vcard__title\">Agent profiles</h3><p>Profiles with reviews, sales history and areas covered, so people choose your agents.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "real-estate-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
