   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Win the map in every area you cover",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-64\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"dark-split dark-split--flip\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dark-split__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"dark-split__title\" id=\"h-64\">Win the map in <span class=\"accent accent--light\">every area you cover</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>People searching “estate agent near me” are ready to talk. We optimise each office’s Google Business Profile and check your rankings across every neighbourhood.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Google Business Profile for each office</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Rank checks across your areas</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Reviews and replies handled</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button--light\" href=\"#proposal\">Get a free area check <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dark-split__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Local rank grid · “real estate agent”</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mk-grid\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Grid of local ranking positions around the business\"><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">6</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">6</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">2</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">1</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">2</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">1</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">1</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">1</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">2</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">1</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">2</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--top\">3</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">6</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">4</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">5</span><span class=\"mk-grid__cell mk-grid__cell--mid\">6</span></div><div class=\"mock-legend\"><span><i style=\"background:#16a35b\"></i>Top 3</span><span><i style=\"background:#e0a21b\"></i>4–10</span><span><i style=\"background:#d9516f\"></i>11+</span></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
