    "label": "Real estate SEO plans",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-66\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-66\">Real estate SEO <span class=\"accent\">plans</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Plans for single offices, growing agencies and developers.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"packages\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"package\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"package__name\">Local agency</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__for\">For one or two offices</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__text\">Local SEO, area guides and agent profiles for the areas you cover.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Google Business Profile</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Area guides</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Monthly report</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button--outline button--block\" href=\"#proposal\">Get a quote <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"package package--featured\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"package__badge\">Most popular</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"package__name\">Growing agency</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__for\">For several offices</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__text\">Everything in Local, plus listing pages, content and links across all your areas.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Everything in Local agency</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Listing and property type pages</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Content and links</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Lead tracking</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button--light button--block\" href=\"#proposal\">Get a quote <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"package\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"package__name\">Developer</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__for\">For projects and launches</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"package__text\">Project pages, launch content and international reach for off-plan sales.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Project and launch pages</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> International buyer content</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Launch reporting</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button--outline button--block\" href=\"#proposal\">Get a quote <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"packages__note\">Every plan is quoted after a free call, so you only pay for what you need.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
